// Marklife media catalogue. Continuous thermal sticker stock plus
// gap / die-cut label stock. No tape cassettes (D1-style), no RFID
// cassettes, no black-line stock in the YXQ media range.
//
// `targetModels` taxonomy is marklife-internal: head-size class.
//
//   - 'narrow-tape'    — 0.5" class (P12, P15, R15, A1, BARABOGOP12, …)
//   - 'mobile-2in'     — 2" class (S2, P50, X2, M50, M57, M60, T2, ETZ0535, JAMMUK_S2, LPW40, …)
//   - 'desktop-3in'    — 3" class (TBD members)
//   - 'industrial-4in' — 4" class (D210, X8, U210, …)
//
// `skus` holds *retailer* product codes (Amazon ASIN, TVCMALL item no.)
// because this range ships no manufacturer part numbers — Marklife's own
// store lists rolls by size only. Each entry carries a one-line comment
// naming the listing the size came from.
